Z||000000||dennis_6||09-24-2001||03:24 AM||||I have been a member of GM forums for quite some time.  They do have a Fiero section, but no one ever visits there.  There is more trafic in the van sections and it is really sad.  This forum is an excellent oppurtunity for others to learn of Fiero's by venturing in there from other sections of the forum.  It would be nice if they actualy saw information about the car.  Who knows we might hook a few people on the Fiero.  I am definetly not trying to draw people away from this forum.  Cliff Pennok is awesome and so is his forum.  I am just saying that if a few people would drop by there every once in a while like you do at ratemyride.com and post something it would be beneficial to the Fiero community.  I am only posting this because I love the Fiero and would like to see more people enjoy this car so please don't flame me.  This just an ideal and only and ideal.  For those who want to check out GM forums: <A HREF="http://www.gmforums.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.gmforums.com</A> <p>[This message has been edited by dennis_6 (edited 09-24-2001).]||||reg||7
